WEBVTT

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:07.200
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it’s this!

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.420
It’s the second Blackwing Synchro Monster!

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:14.990
When it attacks a monster in defense 
position, it gains attack points.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:23.320
3000 attack points?  You must be joking!

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:29.490
I activate my trap Dust Tornado!  
I use this to destroy Discord!

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:33.450
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Imperial Custom.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:38.680
All Continuous Traps on my field other 
than this one cannot be destroyed.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.110
Therefore, Jester Lord 
has 2000 attack points!

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:43.120
What?

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:46.760
Jester Lord attacks you directly.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.350
Well done.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:01:00.020
I didn’t know the Public Maintenance 
Department had someone who did crazy duels.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.820
Thanks for the flattery.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:09.270
You also did well in lowering Jester 
Lord’s attack points by activating a trap.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.980
Then let's keep having fun!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:30.650
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:35.750
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:40.660
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:45.430
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.790
No matter how bad today is

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.780
There’s still the faintest light

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:01.180
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.240
Is light it myself

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:10.250
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:15.220
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:21.520
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:25.500
Today will never exist again

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:31.400
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:54.870 --> 00:03:00.340
Create the Divine Wind!Blackwing Armed Wing

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:08.930
I wonder if the sunset was this 
red five thousand years ago.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.370
Probably.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:16.680
But there’s no guarantee that it will be 
this red tomorrow unless we protect the world.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:18.880
Yeah.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.300
You’re right.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.430
Master Atlas!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.290
I thought you'd be here.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.200
What is it?

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.060
Hey, what is it?

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:46.700
Satellite is in trouble!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.830
What?

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:58.330
Keep on entertaining me!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:01.430
Or are you already ending your turn?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:08.640
Don’t get impatient.  You'll be dancing 
in the palm of my hands soon enough!

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.600
We'll see which one of us is going to dance!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:17.170
I Special Summon Jester Confit 
from my hand in attack position.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.020
What?

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:23.620
Are you mocking me?

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:25.410
Another monster with zero attack points…

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:29.510
And by bringing that out, Jester 
Lord’s effect is negated,

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:32.840
and its attack points revert back to zero.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:35.860
Is he aiming for another crazy combo?

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:38.850
I set one card and end my turn.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:44.080
What are you planning?  You’re so sly.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:46.570
I can say the same about you.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:52.610
But I can figure out what you're planning.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:56.860
Here I go!  My turn!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:05:00.980
At this moment, I activate the 
Continous Trap Late Penalty.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:07.020
If you have no monsters during your Standby 
Phase, your Battle Phase is skipped.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:07.840
What?

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:12.970
You didn’t let me attack last 
turn either!  That’s dirty!

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:17.660
What kind of dance will you show me?

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:23.300
I’m not going to dance for you!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.540
Fake Feather...

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:30.640
By sending a Blackwing monster 
in your hand to the graveyard,

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.500
you can activate a trap card 
in your opponent’s graveyard.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:39.550
If he currently has this trap in 
his hand, that will be bad for me.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:43.430
Even if I can’t attack, 
my pride as a duelist

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:47.630
won’t let me end my turn 
without summoning a monster!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:53.160
I Special Summon Blackwing 
– Sirocco the Dawn!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:06:00.620
The fact that he brought out a 
Blackwing from his hand means…

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.630
When monsters are only on 
the opponent’s field,

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.730
I can summon this without 
releasing other monsters!

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.120
Then I set one card.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.010
Are you ending your turn?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.360
Not yet!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:15.730
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Reload!

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:20.730
I add my hand to my deck and shuffle.  
Then I draw the same number of cards!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.350
That's an all-or-nothing 
approach.  How boring.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:27.060
That’s not what a clown should do.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:30.050
Shut up!  I’m not a clown!

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:34.900
I also set this and end my turn!

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:40.630
Now bring it!  If you can figure out this 
strategy, I’ll dance naked for you!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:45.120
It seems you now have the 
card that you wanted.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:46.920
In that case…

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.790
I use Jester Confit’s monster effect!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.040
What?

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:58.160
During your End Phase, Jester Confit and 
one of your monsters return to our hands.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.230
What?

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:09.610
How horrible!  I just Special Summoned 
Sirocco the Dawn, and it already returns to my hand!

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:15.630
Wait!  This means Jester Lord is the 
only monster on the field.  Therefore...

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:20.060
That’s right.  Jester Lord’s 
monster effect is back.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:25.480
Including the cards you just set, there's 
a total of five spell and trap cards.

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:31.360
That means Jester Lord’s attack points 
equal 1000 points multiplied by 5!

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:34.970
Oh my god!  How horrible!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:39.670
I'm dancing right into that clown's hands!

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:44.680
I’ll now have you exit the stage.  I draw.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:47.200
Taka, Blitz, Nerve, Rally, kids, I’m sorry!

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:53.360
Do you really think that I’ll let my guard 
down and attack if you pretend to look frustrated?

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.270
I won’t be fooled.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:08:01.610
I know the key to your victory 
is hidden in those two set cards.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:08.090
You mocked Security in dozens of duels.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:11.710
All that data has been inputted into this.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:14.770
I have to be careful of Fake Feather.

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:20.380
Sirocco the Dawn just returned to his hand.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:24.720
If he had Fake Feather in 
his hand, he would have kept

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:29.020
Sirocco the Dawn in his hand 
instead of Special Summoning it.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:33.210
Therefore, the first card he 
set wasn’t Fake Feather.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:38.210
In that case, I have to pay attention the 
card he drew using Reload - his second set card.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:44.400
I activate Card of Distrain from my hand!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:53.340
When you have two or more set cards on your 
field, one of them cannot be activated this turn.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:57.310
I select your second set card!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:03.550
The exciting show comes to an end.

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:08.050
Jester Lord, close the curtains 
by attacking him directly!

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:15.010
I activate the trap Fake Feather!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.470
What?

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:23.220
By sending a Blackwing from my hand to the 
graveyard, I can activate one trap in your graveyard!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:27.780
I can do this because you returned 
Sirocco the Dawn back to my hand!

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:32.760
I select Imperial Manners 
that's in your graveyard!

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:39.050
With Imperial Manners, 
when your monster attacks

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:44.250
when there are no monsters on my field, 
all your monsters are destroyed!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.890
Never underestimate my animal-like instincts!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:55.450
It’s a thousand times 
better than your weak data!

00:09:55.450 --> 00:10:00.740
The moment you Special Summoned Jester 
Confit, I knew what your strategy was!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:08.510
You pretended to dance into 
my hands in order to trick me?

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:12.730
Now what kind of dance will you show me?

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:18.990
Interesting.  I didn’t know a duelist like 
you existed among the Satellite sewer rats.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:25.700
Sewer rats and crows are much tougher 
than the weak pets in the City.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:30.200
I’m impressed that you’re 
proud to be a sewer rat.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:34.480
However, Card of Distrain has another effect.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:40.650
If a card other than the one I selected 
activates, you take 800 points of damage!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:44.520
No way!  You must be kidding!

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:49.300
I Special Summon Jester Confit again.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:55.250
It's back again.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.270
When Jester Confit is Special Summoned,

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:02.170
your monster and it both return to 
our hands during your End Phase.

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:05.910
Next, I activate the Equip 
Spell Spirit Burner.

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:10.610
This card switches the equipped 
monster to defense position.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:16.560
When the equipped monster returns to 
my hand, you take 600 points of damage.

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.770
I end my turn.

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.470
How’s that?

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:27.730
If you have no monsters on your field, I can 
prevent you from attacking by using Late Penalty.

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:32.800
Even if you summon a monster, Jester 
Confit will return it to your hand.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:37.430
No matter what you try, you're 
going to keep dancing on the field.

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.010
Do you really think so?

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:48.350
You’re sharp.  This set card really 
is my secret plan for victory!

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:51.210
Now let’s have fun!  My turn!

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:54.740
I activate my trap!  Trap Stun!

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:59.660
The effects of all traps other than 
this one are negated this turn!

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.230
What?

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:06.480
Your three Continuous Traps have been sealed!

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:12.360
In other words, I can Synchro 
Summon, and my monsters can attack!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.990
I summon Blackwing – 
Blizzard the Far North!

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:25.610
When it's successfully summoned, 
I can Special Summon

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:31.210
one Level 4-or-below Blackwing from 
my graveyard in defense position!

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.670
Come, Blackwing – Bora the Spear!

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:37.630
Now here comes today's hero!

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:42.200
Blizzard of the Far North 
tunes Bora the Spear!

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:50.000
Dark power, infuse the gigantic 
wings to create a divine wind!

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.890
Synchro Summon!

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:55.850
Rage, Blackwing Armed Wing!

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.760
I finally let you to Synchro Summon…

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:04.450
But that’s why I put Jester Confit 
in defense position, just in case!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.550
Too bad!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.500
When Armed Wing attacks a 
monster in defense position,

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:13.200
it gains 500 attack points 
and deals piercing damage!

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.710
What?

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:19.400
Now dance!  Armed Wing attacks Jester Confit!

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.040
Black Charge!

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:31.090
Now our life points are equal.

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:33.910
How interesting.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:38.980
It's time to see who's the real clown!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.690
What?

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.360
An earthquake?

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:47.730
This is bad!  Has it started already?

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:17.660
What?

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.610
What’s going on?

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:25.340
Oh no!  I didn’t expect 
it to start this early!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.770
Wait up!  We're in the middle of a duel!

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:32.420
This isn’t the time for that!  I 
have to escape as fast as possible!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:36.920
Stop messing around!  You’re a punk if you 
throw away your life as a duelist and run away!

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:41.960
My actual life is more important right now!

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:46.630
If you also want to live, then run away!

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:50.110
But it might already be too late!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:53.600
You should at least say that we’ll 
continue this battle later!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.780
What?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.810
Damn!  What is that?

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.140
What’s that?

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.390
Damn!  I refuse to die!

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:47.300
I won’t die in a place like this!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.530
I'll put it up on the monitor.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:12.000
This is…

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.000
This is Satellite?

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:17.390
Is it always this foggy?

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:19.160
No, it shouldn’t be.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.300
What happened?

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:24.200
We don’t know the details,

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:28.590
but an unexpected incident occurred 
at the innermost section of Satellite.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.870
The innermost section?

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:34.540
We've lost communication 
with Satellite's Security.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:36.840
We also don’t know how long 
this video feed will last.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:42.500
I can’t stay here and waste my time!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:45.650
I’m flying to Satellite 
immediately!  Ready the helicopter!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.560
Right!

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:50.590
Rally, Crow, everyone…

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:54.120
Tell us what’s going on!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.330
What’s with that fire geoglyph?

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.830
What's happening?

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:02.830
Director Godwin will soon 
make an official statement!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.410
So disperse for now!

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.070
When is he going to make his announcement?

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:09.540
More and more people are 
disappearing into the geoglyph!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:12.250
Aren’t you going to protect us?

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:17.310
Just disperse for now!  Or else, 
we'll arrest you for rioting!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:19.020
That's ridiculous!

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:21.400
I’m in front of the Public 
Maintenance Department.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.700
With no clear details on 
the unexpected events,

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:29.030
the citizens' frustration towards the 
authorities have reached a breaking point-

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.780
Hey Godwin, come out!

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:31.030
Tell us what's happening!

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:34.060
What are you doing?  Don’t 
take the microphone!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:34.400
We know you’re watching, punk!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.040
Come out, Goodwin!

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:35.980
Hey!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.180
Director!  Are you watching the TV?

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:45.290
Please give me some information!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:49.380
Please have the media tell 
the citizens to calm down.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.310
In their current state, I 
don't think they'll calm down!

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:56.690
The reason why I’ve made myself 
available to you is for times like this.

00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:58.290
I’m counting on you, Angela.

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:01.760
You made yourself available?  You haven’t 
given me any good scoops lately!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:05.440
Pardon me, Director.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:06.660
I already know.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:12.200
Please tell the Signers to get 
ready to leave immediately.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:14.170
Understood.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:27.550
It’s almost time.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:28.480
Yeah.

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:30.770
Master Atlas…

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:31.780
What is it?

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:35.050
Master Atlas, why are you going to Satellite?

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.450
You know that there's something I need to do.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:42.830
Is that as a Signer?

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.220
Or as a…

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:50.940
The fog that's covering Satellite seems to be 
coming from the location of the previous Moment.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.400
Previous Moment?

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.910
What’s that?

00:18:53.910 --> 00:19:00.700
Destiny is guiding the son of Professor 
Fudo, the creator of the previous Moment.

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:03.390
The creator's son?

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.860
Yusei?

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.340
What do you mean?

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:13.730
The gears of fate have begun to turn.

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:16.910
Your mission is to defeat the Dark Signers

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:21.410
and make the previous Moment 
rotate in the proper direction.

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:37.370
Officer Ushio has arrived!

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.540
Thank you.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.390
Oh, it’s you.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.220
What do you mean by that?

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:48.230
The Director personally ordered me 
to take you to that garbage dump!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:50.020
Are you coming with us?

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:53.990
Yes!  I’m glad I can help you, Mikage.

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:57.170
It's too early in the day to have 
such a tough job, Officer Ushio.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.180
It’s nothing.

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:02.020
Everyone, please come this way.

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.050
Let’s go.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.060
Yeah!

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.150
Wait.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.560
What’s wrong, Yusei?

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.610
Godwin, I want you to promise one thing.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:11.870
What is it?

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:15.990
If we defeat the Dark Signers 
and return everything to normal,

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:20.990
you have to promise that you'll connect 
the Daedalus Bridge with the City.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.970
Daedalus Bridge…

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:30.660
Daedalus Bridge connects 
Satellite and the City.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:37.230
Are you emulating the legendary man 
who fought to connect that bridge?

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:42.960
If your story is true, there will no longer 
be a reason to discriminate against Satellite.

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:46.890
Fine.  I promise.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:01.570
I promise to make Satellite 
and the City into one.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.740
Even if it costs me my life.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.660
Lua!  Luca!

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:25.670
Bro!  Luca!  Lua!

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:26.840
Tempei!

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.630
Himuro!  Grandpa!

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:30.170
Do your best!

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.030
Come back safely!

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:33.890
Don’t die, Yusei!

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:35.620
Thank you, everyone!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:37.570
We’re going!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:43.310
I must win this fight for everyone!

00:21:57.180 --> 00:22:01.650
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.010 --> 00:22:06.720
We will build our own future

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:12.160
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.620 --> 00:22:17.330
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:32.470
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:38.040
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.110 --> 00:22:42.750
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:48.020
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:22:48.020 --> 00:22:52.490
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:58.070
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.200 --> 00:23:02.880
This journey has no end

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:08.410
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:13.650
Hear my voice
